        <item>
            <title>0.3.71</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 01:55:07 -0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/leonlufkin/base-releases/releases/tag/v0.3.71-261109015507</link>
            <sparkle:version>261109015507</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.71</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Replaces verbose submitted/awaiting-confirmation labels with WhatsApp-style delivery indicators at the bottom-right of outgoing messages: a clock while sending, one check after host submission, and two accent-colored checks after agent confirmation. Confirmed history keeps the double checks. Hover/accessibility labels expose status, and clicking an unresolved check only refreshes receipts. Failure details and safe retry controls remain available. Existing receipt authority, replay protections, password-free policy, and session-kill fixes are unchanged. Sparkle installs Base.app only; providers, daemon, runners, windows, Spaces, and drafts are preserved. iOS feed unchanged.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/leonlufkin/base-releases/releases/download/v0.3.71-261109015507/Base-0.3.71-261109015507-macOS.zip" length="12589678" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="bzRE68ZPWcx4fSPjGvHnVIeMjrAmL9CT1hwgU2mu3rECt/DE1GiV03tZxCK729UN33lSMSud9chwvssvpKyBAA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.3.70</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:18:45 -0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/leonlufkin/base-releases/releases/tag/v0.3.70-261109000207</link>
            <sparkle:version>261109000207</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.70</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Fixes session termination when a stale native chat remains visible after its runtime disappears. Native Kill checks the exact host and conversation, uses the native stop route, and reconciles failed stops before clearing a row; a missing runner alone never counts as successful termination. Already-gone legacy targets are handled idempotently after authoritative enumeration. History, drafts, neighboring sessions, network gates, and agent permissions are preserved. Includes the password-free local authorization and compact-sidebar corrections. Sparkle installs Base.app only; runtime binaries are separate assets.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/leonlufkin/base-releases/releases/download/v0.3.70-261109000207/Base-0.3.70-261109000207-macOS.zip" length="12580411" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="VGpe6LDUSyb9Jzxo7U7Qla8eGXFgZtg1saJIL31lRiMPN7UsJBY1ibdsUNVJPJllfSpLNBnMH1726F5dcVFDDA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.3.69</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:32:36 -0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/leonlufkin/base-releases/releases/tag/v0.3.69-261108232621</link>
            <sparkle:version>261108232621</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.69</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Removes automatic Base credential prompts. The Mac app once configures its existing private local runtime for trusted-network native actions without restarting the daemon or agent sessions. Keychain reads cannot authenticate interactively; CLI commands no longer collect passwords from the terminal. Network/origin checks and scoped-agent permissions remain enforced. Deliberately strict runtime administration retains explicit credential-fd support. Sparkle installs Base.app only; CLI, daemon, and runner binaries are separate assets.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/leonlufkin/base-releases/releases/download/v0.3.69-261108232621/Base-0.3.69-261108232621-macOS.zip" length="12547630" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="l2LYZpsE1iJ32L5ipGENDJpyzUeDXuDxn/uu5N2aQ5cYQ7UjEU171WKzx8z4qqOl6mZznCNcOfKtZDgg4NIBDw=="/>
        </item>
